                        </div>
                        <div class="article-content">
                            <h2 style="text-align: center;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Cochise College Athletic Training</strong></span></h2>
<p style="text-align: center;">The Cochise College Athletic Training Room is the hub for student-athlete care, offering expert injury prevention, evaluation, treatment, and rehabilitation. Our two certified athletic trainers provide hands-on support to keep Cochise athletes performing at their best &mdash; on the field, in the gym, and beyond.</p>
<h3 style="text-align: left;"><strong>COCHISE STUDENT-ATHLETE APPOINTMENT BOOKING LINK</strong> <a href="https://dashboard.healthyroster.com/scheduling/cochiseatr/self-scheduler">CLICK HERE</a></h3>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left; padding-left: 480px;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src="/information/JUrquijo2026.png?max_height=150&amp;max_width=150" alt="JUquijo" width="150" height="150">
</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><em><strong>Johanna Urquijo-Head Athletic Trainer</strong></em><em><strong><br>

<br>

</strong></em></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;<img src="/information/IMadrid2026.png?max_height=155&amp;max_width=155" alt="IMadrid" width="155" height="155">
</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><em><strong>Iris Madrid-Assistant Athletic Trainer</strong></em></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><em>More Coming Soon!</em></p>


                        </div>
